WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.868 size:75% position:38%
-I thought I'd share
some of my favorite

00:00:01.868 --> 00:00:03.303 align:start size:94% position:6%
"my bad luck" stories
from you guys.

00:00:03.303 --> 00:00:06.906 align:start size:94% position:6%
This first one
from @sanemomofmany.

00:00:06.906 --> 00:00:09.275 align:start size:94% position:6%
She says, "I thought I won
the Michigan lottery

00:00:09.275 --> 00:00:11.344 align:start size:94% position:6%
after I hit all five numbers
and the Powerball,

00:00:11.344 --> 00:00:15.281
then realized I was looking at
a ticket from the week before."

00:00:15.281 --> 00:00:16.049 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Audience awws ]

00:00:16.049 --> 00:00:18.551 align:start size:94% position:6%
Just reading your ticket.
"Oh, my gosh!

00:00:18.551 --> 00:00:21.721
I got my numbers that I choose.
From the week before."

00:00:21.721 --> 00:00:23.490 line:92%
Yeah, that's your ticket.

00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:25.091 line:92%
This one is from @angelfan.

00:00:25.091 --> 00:00:28.661
She says, "When I was young,
I went through a haunted house,

00:00:28.661 --> 00:00:30.330 line:92%
fell down, and twisted my ankle.

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:31.164 line:92%
I started yelling for help,

00:00:31.164 --> 00:00:34.367 align:start size:94% position:6%
but everyone thought I was
an actor and stepped over me."

00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:38.171 size:88% position:44%
"It's pretty realistic!
That's pretty realistic!

00:00:38.171 --> 00:00:39.339 line:92%
She looks like she's in pain!

00:00:39.339 --> 00:00:41.408 align:start size:94% position:6%
"She's, like, really crying.
Real tears."

00:00:41.408 --> 00:00:44.677
-Oh, man. She looks like
she's really in pain, man.

00:00:44.677 --> 00:00:46.780 line:92%
That looks like real blood!"

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:50.116 align:start size:94% position:6%
This one is from @bearknowy.
-Bearknowy?

00:00:50.116 --> 00:00:53.119 size:84% position:42%
-He says, "Out of habit
from texting my wife,

00:00:53.119 --> 00:00:55.922 align:start size:94% position:6%
I ended a text to my boss
with 'I love you.'

00:00:55.922 --> 00:00:58.525 align:start size:94% position:6%
He texted back,
'I love you, too.'"

00:00:58.525 --> 00:01:01.594 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Aww. Hey.

00:01:01.594 --> 00:01:04.164 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's kind of cute.
-Bearknowy.

00:01:04.164 --> 00:01:07.500 line:92%
-This one's from @Sonyaday11.

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:11.004 align:start size:94% position:6%
She says,
"My car was hit by a bathtub

00:01:11.004 --> 00:01:11.771 line:92%
that fell out of a truck.

00:01:11.771 --> 00:01:14.574 align:start size:94% position:6%
They don't teach you
to avoid falling bathtubs

00:01:14.574 --> 00:01:15.775 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
in drivers ed."

00:01:15.775 --> 00:01:20.780 size:84% position:42% line:92%
It's like, "A bathtub?"

00:01:20.780 --> 00:01:23.616 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Um...

00:01:23.616 --> 00:01:25.952 line:92%
this one's from @slurpeegirl.

00:01:25.952 --> 00:01:26.553 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Uh-oh.

00:01:26.553 --> 00:01:28.755 align:start size:94% position:6%
-She says,
"I was making mashed potatoes

00:01:28.755 --> 00:01:29.422 size:88% position:44% line:92%
using an electric mixer.

00:01:29.422 --> 00:01:32.892
Little did I realize, I was
scraping all of the Teflon

00:01:32.892 --> 00:01:34.160 line:92%
off the pan I was mashing in.

00:01:34.160 --> 00:01:37.530 align:start size:94% position:6%
I told my boyfriend the chewy
black bits were pepper."

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:39.499 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:39.499 --> 00:01:40.867 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:01:40.867 --> 00:01:44.704 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, God.
"Why am I so sick?'

00:01:44.704 --> 00:01:47.574 line:92%
-"It doesn't taste that spicy."

00:01:47.574 --> 00:01:50.376 line:92%
Oh, yeah. You're eating Teflon.

00:01:50.376 --> 00:01:52.112 line:92%
This one's from @Juderee.

00:01:52.112 --> 00:01:54.547
She says, "I was walking
on a boardwalk at the beach

00:01:54.547 --> 00:01:58.151
and got slapped in the face
with a huge slice of ham.

00:01:58.151 --> 00:02:00.653 size:81% position:41% line:92%
A seagull dropped it."

00:02:00.653 --> 00:02:02.322 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Sure. Sure.

00:02:02.322 --> 00:02:04.591 align:start size:94% position:6%
Come on, dude.
-Come on.

00:02:04.591 --> 00:02:06.192 line:92%
-That's called a ham slap.

00:02:06.192 --> 00:02:08.995
-That's worse than -- That's
worse than a bird pooping.

00:02:08.995 --> 00:02:12.432
Yeah, exactly. It's much worse.
-Maybe it was poop.

00:02:12.432 --> 00:02:15.301 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:15.301 --> 00:02:17.837 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Giant ham seagull.

00:02:17.837 --> 00:02:20.140 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Slap! ]

00:02:20.140 --> 00:02:22.542 line:92%
That's what it sounds like.

00:02:22.542 --> 00:02:26.713 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:26.713 --> 00:02:29.682 line:92%
-Last one is from @colbybarrend.

00:02:29.682 --> 00:02:31.651
He says,
"I left my ex a drunk voicemail

00:02:31.651 --> 00:02:33.486 size:88% position:44%
to come over one night,
but she never showed up.

00:02:33.486 --> 00:02:36.990
Turns out I sent the message
to my mom. She did show up."

00:02:36.990 --> 00:02:38.858 align:start size:94% position:6%
There you go.
There you have it.

00:02:38.858 --> 00:02:40.326 align:start size:94% position:6%
